The current theory is that this might be related to kubelet assuming that a CSI driver does real mounts, something that the mock driver (and potentially other) CSI drivers don't do. A fix for that is pending in https://github.com/kubernetes/kubernetes/pull/88759

That this test runs into this randomly is caused by the test doing more strict checking of CSI calls than other tests. The flaky test failures could be avoided by relaxing that checking, but that won't fix the underlying issue.
